  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Black Spear Task Force",
    "summary": "Each friendly KILL TEAM unit that has this ability gains three abilities: Purgatus Tactics, Furor Tactics and Malleus Tactics. Purgatus Tactics: while it has the assault doctrine active, its attacks against enemy units within 9\" of it have [PRECISION]. Furor Tactics: [SUSTAINED HITS 1] on the unit's attacks while it has the devastator doctrine active. Malleus Tactics: [LETHAL HITS] on its attacks while it has the tactical doctrine active.\nYour army may include ADEPTUS ASTARTES DEATHWATCH units; no ADEPTUS ASTARTES units from other Chapters are allowed. It also cannot include AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM DEATHWATCH units, apart from KILL TEAM CASSIUS (see Legends: Agents of the Imperium).",
